Massive tender splenomegaly, Left upper quadrant dragging sensation, Marked leukocytosis with left shift, Philadelphia chromosome t(9;22) positive

VISIT CONTEXT

Case ID: HMO-015
Reason for Visit: Sudden, severe left upper quadrant abdominal pain and profound lethargy requiring urgent physical assessment to exclude acute splenic rupture or infarction.
Location: Private residence
